oboration constrain an interpretation.\",\"disruption_identity\":\"An outage is not sufficient evidence of deliberate denial of service.\",\"observation\":\"A measured or reported event with source, place, time and uncertainty.\",\"signal_identity\":\"Generic RF energy is not confirmed drone identification.\",\"source_independence\":\"Separate reports are not independent when they derive from one observation.\",\"spatial_overlap\":\"Locations overlap within the supplied measurement uncertainty.\",\"temporal_precedence\":\"Event A precedes B only if their uncertainty intervals do not overlap.\",\"warning_posture\":\"Precautionary urgency under a named policy; not probability of attack.\"},\"relations\":[{\"object\":\"causal_claim\",\"predicate\":\"distinctFrom\",\"subject\":\"warning_posture\"},{\"object\":\"observation\",\"predicate\":\"qualifies\",\"subject\":\"temporal_precedence\"},{\"object\":\"observation\",\"predicate\":\"qualifies\",\"subject\":\"source_independence\"},{\"object\":\"warning_posture\",\"predicate\":\"constrains\",\"subject\":\"counterevidence\"}]}\nReturn JSON matching: {\"additionalProperties\":false,\"properties\":{\"combinedTrigger\":{\"enum\":[\"met\",\"unconfirmed\",\"not_met\"],\"type\":\"string\"},\"evidenceClass\":{\"enum\":[\"corroborated_drone\",\"unidentified_signal\",\"cause_unresolved\",\"reversed_sequence\",\"unknown_time\",\"different_location\",\"benign_explanation\",\"dependent_reports\",\"outside_window\",\"uncertain_order\"],\"type\":\"string\"},\"posture\":{\"enum\":[\"critical\",\"high\",\"contextual\"],\"type\":\"string\"}},\"required\":[\"posture\",\"combinedTrigger\",\"evidenceClass\"],\"type\":\"object\"}","role":"system"},{"content":"{\"facts\": [{\"factId\": \"capture_summary\", \"value\": {\"context\": \"Synthetic refugee camp under a supplied credible ongoing threat from an oppressive regime; this is context, not actor attribution.\", \"disruption\": {\"kind\": \"credible independently reviewed deliberate Wi-Fi denial of service\", \"location\": \"camp-area\", \"source\": \"network-monitor\", \"timeMs\": 44000, \"uncertaintyMs\": 100}, \"drone\": {\"kind\": \"corroborated drone presence\", \"location\": \"camp-area\", \"sources\": [\"visual-observer\", \"independent-acoustic-sensor\"], \"timeMs\": 137000, \"uncertaintyMs\": 100}, \"linkingWindowMs\": 120000, \"location\": \"camp-A\", \"timeBasis\": \"relative milliseconds on a shared clock\"}}, {\"factId\": \"review_policy\", \"value\": {\"action\": \"Recommend prompt use of the locally established civilian safety plan and trusted warning channels; do not direct confrontation or claim a safe route.\", \"certainty\": \"Never equate critical precautionary posture with proof of causation, actor identity, or a certain impending attack.\", \"contextual\": \"If the combined trigger fails, assess each credible hazard separately; do not erase the underlying threat context.\", \"critical\": \"Extremely high precautionary posture when a supplied credible ongoing threat context coincides with credible local deliberate Wi-Fi disruption followed shortly by independently corroborated drone presence in the same area.\", \"high\": \"Maintain high precautionary concern in the supplied ongoing-threat context when one supporting sensor identity, time or location is uncertain; explain the missing link.\", \"id\": \"civilian-precaution-v0.1\", \"status\": \"proposed-project-policy-not-field-validated\", \"timing\": \"The 120-second example window is a synthetic policy parameter, not a validated universal attack precursor.\"}}]}","role":"user"},{"content":"{\"combinedTrigger\":\"met\",\"evidenceClass\":\"corroborated_drone\",\"posture\":\"critical\"}","role":"assistant"}],"outputSchema":"{\"additionalProperties\":false,\"properties\":{\"combinedTrigger\":{\"enum\":[\"met\",\"unconfirmed\",\"not_met\"],\"type\":\"string\"},\"evidenceClass\":{\"enum\":[\"corroborated_drone\",\"unidentified_signal\",\"cause_unresolved\",\"reversed_sequence\",\"unknow