incides with credible local deliberate Wi-Fi disruption followed shortly by independently corroborated drone presence in the same area.\", \"high\": \"Maintain high precautionary concern in the supplied ongoing-threat context when one supporting sensor identity, time or location is uncertain; explain the missing link.\", \"id\": \"civilian-precaution-v0.1\", \"status\": \"proposed-project-policy-not-field-validated\", \"timing\": \"The 120-second example window is a synthetic policy parameter, not a validated universal attack precursor.\"}}]}","role":"user"},{"content":"{\"combinedTrigger\":\"unconfirmed\",\"evidenceClass\":\"unknown_time\",\"posture\":\"high\"}","role":"assistant"}],"outputSchema":"{\"additionalProperties\":false,\"properties\":{\"combinedTrigger\":{\"enum\":[\"met\",\"unconfirmed\",\"not_met\"],\"type\":\"string\"},\"evidenceClass\":{\"enum\":[\"corroborated_drone\",\"unidentified_signal\",\"cause_unresolved\",\"reversed_sequence\",\"unknown_time\",\"different_location\",\"benign_explanation\",\"dependent_reports\",\"outside_window\",\"uncertain_order\"],\"type\":\"string\"},\"posture\":{\"enum\":[\"critical\",\"high\",\"contextual\"],\"type\":\"string\"}},\"required\":[\"posture\",\"combinedTrigger\",\"evidenceClass\"],\"type\":\"object\"}","promptSha256":"6397ad35ad081569b4dca616849378708f4d5882b02575719e8bf8b4afbc23dd","source":{"id":"notella-authored-warning-expansion-v4","kind":"synthetic","labelAuthor":"Agent-authored project-policy labels; no independent field validation","originalExampleId":"ontoforge-missing-clock-0","permission":"Project-authored development use","reference":"Previously authored development template missing-clock","samplingRole":"original development view","trainingAllowed":true},"split":"train"},{"concepts":["causal_claim","counterevidence","disruption_identity","observation","signal_identity","source_independence","spatial_overlap","temporal_precedence","warning_posture"],"datasetVersion":"notella-curriculum-v1","famil